* **The Student Mastery Failure Matrix Database:**
    * *Implementation:* An analytics logger that aggregates anonymized text inputs, tracking precise logic gaps and concept-specific failure vectors across demographic cohorts.
    * *Strategic Utility:* Builds a proprietary and highly defensible data asset. Capturing real-world student learning breakdowns at scale creates a valuable dataset that strengthens the platform's intellectual property.
